.TH XIL\-STEM\-COMPARE "1" "2026\-07\-29" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-stem\-compare
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-stem\-compare
[-h] [--show SLUG] [--episode TAG] [--stem-verify FILE] [--parsed FILE] [--threshold FLOAT] [--output FILE] [--csv]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Cross\-reference Whisper transcripts against parsed script dialogue to flag garbled stems.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,SLUG\/\fR, \fB\-s\fR \fI\,SLUG\/\fR
Show slug (default: resolved from project.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR, \fB\-e\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Episode tag, e.g. S01E01 (derives both JSON paths if not overridden)

.TP
\fB\-\-stem\-verify\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Path to stem_verify JSON (default:
<workspace>/parsed/<slug>/stem_verify_<episode>.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-parsed\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Path to parsed script JSON (default:
<workspace>/parsed/<slug>/parsed_<episode>.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-threshold\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
Similarity below this marks a stem as garbled (default: 0.75)

.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Write full JSON report to this file (in addition to terminal output)

.TP
\fB\-\-csv\fR
Print flagged entries as CSV to stdout instead of the banner summary

